  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: 'You dedicated yourself to intense training and rigorous study to
    become a great warrior. The school you attended might have been a traditionalist
    monastery, an elite military academy, or the local branch of a prestigious mercenary
    organization. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Dexterity
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You''re trained in your choice of the Acrobatics
    or Athletics skill. You gain a skill feat: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Cat
    Fall] if you chose Acrobatics or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick Jump]
    if you chose Athletics. You''re also trained in the Warfare Lore skill.'
